# Python Environment Setup

Before running any Python code, tests, or scripts in this project, always use the `adt_py310` conda environment.

## Required Steps

1. Activate the environment:
   ```bash
   conda activate adt_py310
   ```
2. Install the project in editable mode:
   ```bash
   pip install -e ".[dev]"
   ```

## Shell Commands

Always prefix terminal commands with the activation when the environment may not already be active:

```bash
conda run -n adt_py310 <your command>
# or
conda activate adt_py310 && <your command>
```
